{# A post's pickles (models::pickle): how many it has, and for a supporter
   with this week's still to give, the button that gives it. It is not one
   of the reaction chips, and does not look like 🥒, which is a reaction
   anyone can leave as often as they like.

   Nothing is shown on a post with no pickles to a viewer who cannot give
   one. `post_author_id` is whose post it is, since nobody gives their own
   a pickle.

   A jar for each pickle, up to five; past that, one jar, since a row of
   twelve would push the reactions off a phone's line. Either way the chip
   says it in words too ("2 pickles"): a jar on its own is a picture nobody
   has been taught, and pressing the chip says what a pickle is and how
   anyone comes to have one. The give button adds a faded jar after the
   others, the place the giver's own will go, and says "Give pickle". #}
{% from "pickle_about_macro.jinja" import pickle_about %}
{% macro jars(count) -%}
  {%- for _ in range(count if count <= 5 else 1) %}{% include "pickle_icon.jinja" %}{% endfor -%}
{%- endmacro %}
{% set own_post = current_user and current_user.id == post_author_id %}
{% set can_give = pickles.weekly_available and not pickles.given_by_viewer and not own_post %}
{% if pickles.given_by_viewer %}
  {% set pickle_title = ftl_get_message("post-pickle-given") %}
{% elif can_give %}
  {% set pickle_title = ftl_get_message("post-pickle-give") %}
{% elif current_user and not own_post %}
  {% set pickle_title = ftl_get_message("post-pickle-supporters") %}
{% else %}
  {% set pickle_title = ftl_get_message("post-pickles") %}
{% endif %}
<div id="post-pickles-{{ post_id }}" class="post-pickles">
  {%- if can_give %}
    <button class="pickle-button" data-haptic="medium"
            hx-post="/posts/{{ post_id }}/pickles"
            hx-target="#post-pickles-{{ post_id }}"
            hx-swap="outerHTML"
            hx-confirm="{{ ftl_get_message('post-pickle-give-confirm') }}"
            data-confirm-action="{{ ftl_get_message('post-pickle-give-action') }}"
            data-confirm-tone="plain"
            hx-disabled-elt="this"
            title="{{ pickle_title }}">
      {{ jars(pickles.count) }}<span class="pickle-slot">{% include "pickle_icon.jinja" %}</span>
      <span class="pickle-label">{{ ftl_get_message("post-pickle-give-action") }}</span>
      {%- if pickles.count > 0 %}<span class="sr-only">, {{ ftl_format_pattern("post-pickle-count", {"count": pickles.count}) }}</span>{% endif %}
    </button>
  {% elif pickles.count > 0 %}
    {% call pickle_about("pickle-chip" ~ (" given" if pickles.given_by_viewer else ""), pickle_title,
                         ftl_get_message("post-pickle-given") if pickles.given_by_viewer else none, pickles) %}
      {{- jars(pickles.count) }}<span class="pickle-label">{{ ftl_format_pattern("post-pickle-count", {"count": pickles.count}) }}</span>
    {%- endcall %}
  {% endif -%}
</div>
